Cell["\<\
These do not take into account rotational equivalence, e.g., the \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]two\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] 2-colorings of the \
octahedron are actually identical since rotating by 90\[Degree] is equivalent \
to swapping colors on faces.  Here is the correct table:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.652009313620838*^9, 3.652009431455435*^9}, {
  3.652009640464374*^9, 3.652009640988924*^9}}],

